{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2021-05-17 17:15:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ANNOUNCES THE ASSET ACQUISITION OF PIPER JORDAN', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., MAY 17, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- J. SCOTT PENNY, CHIEF ACQUISITIONS OFFICER OF BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO), AND ROBYN PIPER AND JAY JORDAN, THE PRINCIPALS OF PIPER JORDAN, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT BROWN & BROWN HAS ACQUIRED SUBSTANTIALLY ALL OF THE ASSETS OF PIPER JORDAN.'}